# Digital Media Store Dataset

## This project includes 7 self-generated and solved business questions/problems, focusing on a dataset for a digital media store and includes tables for artists, albums, media tracks, invoices, and customers.

----

### 1) Which tracks in the catalog have never been purchased? **Why it's valuable:** Highlights "dead weight" in the inventory. If the company pays hosting or licensing fees for these tracks, identifying them allows for strategic removal or aggressive discount promotions.

#### SQL SOLUTION:

SELECT
    t.name as track_name,
    art.name as artist_name,
    a.title as album_title,
    COUNT(t.TrackId) OVER(PARTITION BY art.Name) as bad_tracks_per_artist
FROM tracks t
LEFT JOIN invoice_items i ON t.TrackId = i.TrackId
JOIN albums a ON t.AlbumId = a.AlbumId
JOIN artists art ON a.ArtistId = art.ArtistId
WHERE i.InvoiceLineId IS NULL
ORDER BY bad_tracks_per_artist DESC;

